{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42622","headline":"送杜郎中入茶山修贡 · 杨夔","name":"送杜郎中入茶山修贡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一道澄澜彻底清，仙郎轻棹出重城。\n采苹虚得当时称，述职那同此日荣。\n剑戟步经高障黑，绮罗光动百花明。\n谢公携妓东山去，何似乘春奉昭行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}